# Tests — MSA Schedule 4 claiming a Service Credit

Assertion-based tests for `Service_credit_claim`. The Measurement Period ends
on 31 January 2025 throughout, so the L-5.1 deadline is 2 March 2025, and the
window is tested on both sides of it: a claim on day 30 is in time, a claim on
day 31 is waived. Both branches of the L-5.2 settlement hierarchy are covered,
with their dates.

> Using ServiceCreditClaim

## L5_1_ClaimOnDayThirty

L-5.1: "within 30 days after the end of the Measurement Period" is inclusive
of the thirtieth day, so a claim on 2 March is in time.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestL5_1_ClaimOnDayThirty:
  output r content ServiceCreditClaim.CreditClaim

scope TestL5_1_ClaimOnDayThirty:
  definition r equals
    output of ServiceCreditClaim.CreditClaim with {
      -- measurement_period_end: |2025-01-31|
      -- claim_made: true
      -- claim_date: |2025-03-02|
      -- claim_accepted_date: |2025-03-10|
      -- further_invoice_expected: true
      -- next_invoice_date: |2025-04-01|
    }
  assertion r.claim_deadline = |2025-03-02|
  assertion r.claim_in_time = true
  assertion r.waived = false
```

## L5_1_ClaimOnDayThirtyOne

L-5.1: one day later and the Service Credit is waived.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestL5_1_ClaimOnDayThirtyOne:
  output r content ServiceCreditClaim.CreditClaim

scope TestL5_1_ClaimOnDayThirtyOne:
  definition r equals
    output of ServiceCreditClaim.CreditClaim with {
      -- measurement_period_end: |2025-01-31|
      -- claim_made: true
      -- claim_date: |2025-03-03|
      -- claim_accepted_date: |2025-03-10|
      -- further_invoice_expected: true
      -- next_invoice_date: |2025-04-01|
    }
  assertion r.claim_deadline = |2025-03-02|
  assertion r.claim_in_time = false
  assertion r.waived = true
```

## L5_1_EarlyClaim

L-5.1: a claim made promptly after the end of the period is plainly in time.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestL5_1_EarlyClaim:
  output r content ServiceCreditClaim.CreditClaim

scope TestL5_1_EarlyClaim:
  definition r equals
    output of ServiceCreditClaim.CreditClaim with {
      -- measurement_period_end: |2025-01-31|
      -- claim_made: true
      -- claim_date: |2025-02-03|
      -- claim_accepted_date: |2025-02-10|
      -- further_invoice_expected: true
      -- next_invoice_date: |2025-03-01|
    }
  assertion r.claim_in_time = true
  assertion r.waived = false
```

## L5_1_NoClaimAtAll

L-5.1: "a Service Credit not claimed within that period is waived" catches the
Customer who never claims, not only the one who claims late.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestL5_1_NoClaimAtAll:
  output r content ServiceCreditClaim.CreditClaim

scope TestL5_1_NoClaimAtAll:
  definition r equals
    output of ServiceCreditClaim.CreditClaim with {
      -- measurement_period_end: |2025-01-31|
      -- claim_made: false
      -- claim_date: |2025-02-03|
      -- claim_accepted_date: |2025-02-10|
      -- further_invoice_expected: true
      -- next_invoice_date: |2025-03-01|
    }
  assertion r.claim_in_time = false
  assertion r.waived = true
```

## L5_1_LongMonthDeadline

L-5.1: the deadline is 30 days from the end of the period, not the end of the
following month. April ends on the 30th, so the deadline is 30 May.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestL5_1_LongMonthDeadline:
  output r content ServiceCreditClaim.CreditClaim

scope TestL5_1_LongMonthDeadline:
  definition r equals
    output of ServiceCreditClaim.CreditClaim with {
      -- measurement_period_end: |2025-04-30|
      -- claim_made: true
      -- claim_date: |2025-05-30|
      -- claim_accepted_date: |2025-06-02|
      -- further_invoice_expected: true
      -- next_invoice_date: |2025-07-01|
    }
  assertion r.claim_deadline = |2025-05-30|
  assertion r.claim_in_time = true
  assertion r.waived = false
```

## L5_2_SetOffAgainstNextInvoice

L-5.2 base case: the credit is applied against the next invoice issued after
the claim is accepted.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestL5_2_SetOffAgainstNextInvoice:
  output r content ServiceCreditClaim.CreditClaim

scope TestL5_2_SetOffAgainstNextInvoice:
  definition r equals
    output of ServiceCreditClaim.CreditClaim with {
      -- measurement_period_end: |2025-01-31|
      -- claim_made: true
      -- claim_date: |2025-02-03|
      -- claim_accepted_date: |2025-02-10|
      -- further_invoice_expected: true
      -- next_invoice_date: |2025-03-01|
    }
  assertion r.settlement = AppliedAgainstNextInvoice
  assertion r.settlement_due_date = |2025-03-01|
```

## L5_2_PaidWhereNoFurtherInvoice

L-5.2 exception: where no further invoice will be issued the credit is paid,
within 30 days of acceptance of the claim.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestL5_2_PaidWhereNoFurtherInvoice:
  output r content ServiceCreditClaim.CreditClaim

scope TestL5_2_PaidWhereNoFurtherInvoice:
  definition r equals
    output of ServiceCreditClaim.CreditClaim with {
      -- measurement_period_end: |2025-01-31|
      -- claim_made: true
      -- claim_date: |2025-02-03|
      -- claim_accepted_date: |2025-02-10|
      -- further_invoice_expected: false
      -- next_invoice_date: |2025-03-01|
    }
  assertion r.settlement = PaidToCustomer
  assertion r.settlement_due_date = |2025-03-12|
```

## L5_2_SettlementIsIndependentOfWaiver

L-5.1 and L-5.2 answer different questions. A waived credit is still routed by
L-5.2's mechanics, so the two outputs must be read together: `waived` is what
says there is nothing to settle.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestL5_2_SettlementIsIndependentOfWaiver:
  output r content ServiceCreditClaim.CreditClaim

scope TestL5_2_SettlementIsIndependentOfWaiver:
  definition r equals
    output of ServiceCreditClaim.CreditClaim with {
      -- measurement_period_end: |2025-01-31|
      -- claim_made: true
      -- claim_date: |2025-03-03|
      -- claim_accepted_date: |2025-03-10|
      -- further_invoice_expected: false
      -- next_invoice_date: |2025-04-01|
    }
  assertion r.waived = true
  assertion r.settlement = PaidToCustomer
  assertion r.settlement_due_date = |2025-04-09|
```
